{"id":"a15944d89f213496","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-thm-supercompact-cardinal.md","title":"Supercompact Embedding Characterization","display":"thm-supercompact-embedding-characterization — Supercompact Embedding Characterization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-supercompact-embedding-characterization","aliases":["58-thm-supercompact-embedding-characterization","58-thm-supercompact-cardinal","Supercompact Embedding Characterization"],"display":"thm-supercompact-embedding-characterization — Supercompact Embedding Characterization","depends_on":["[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[../batch18/58-df-supercompact-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-supercompact-embedding-characterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-supercompact-embedding-characterization</span><span>58-thm-supercompact-cardinal</span><span>Supercompact Embedding Characterization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-supercompact-embedding-characterization — Supercompact Embedding Characterization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"623edb148c120615\" href=\"?note=623edb148c120615\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-supercompact-cardinal.md\">../batch18/58-df-supercompact-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"362d2f33099adc89\" href=\"?note=362d2f33099adc89\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9976e7d9d98187f6\" href=\"?note=9976e7d9d98187f6\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md\">../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\operatorname{Supercompact}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\operatorname{Supercompact}\\subseteq V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Class}\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Class}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L_\\in)\\in V\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L_\\in)\\in V\\)</span> and class functions <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> are interpreted in the metatheory</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,j\">\\(M,j\\)</span> 为元语言类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{Class}\">\\(\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{Class}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists j\\in\\mathsf{Class}\">\\(\\exists j\\in\\mathsf{Class}\\)</span> 为类量词记号，不是集合上的存在量词。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:V\\to M\">\\(j:V\\to M\\)</span> 表示总单值类函数图。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\in=\\langle\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle\\dot\\in,2\\rangle\\}\\rangle\">\\(L_\\in=\\langle\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle\\dot\\in,2\\rangle\\}\\rangle\\)</span>。公式、自由变量、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_i\">\\(v_i\\)</span> 与成员结构满意关系取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9976e7d9d98187f6\" href=\"?note=9976e7d9d98187f6\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md\">../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V^r\">\\(V^r\\)</span> 仅表示长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 的有限集合赋值类。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}_S\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"362d2f33099adc89\" href=\"?note=362d2f33099adc89\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf V=V\">\\(\\mathbf V=V\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\">\\(\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\)</span> 在序数参数上表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\kappa\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\lambda\\to M\">\\(f:\\lambda\\to M\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\lambda,\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\subseteq M\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\lambda,\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\subseteq M\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}supercompact\\text{-}embedding\\text{-}characterization} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\operatorname{Supercompact}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa\\leq\\lambda\\to\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{Class}\\;\\exists j\\in\\mathsf{Class}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}_S(M)\\land j:V\\to M\\land\\bigl[\\forall r\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L_\\in)\\;\\forall\\vec a\\in V^r\\;(\\mathrm{FV}_{L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;r\\}\\to(\\langle V,\\in\\rangle\\models\\varphi[\\vec a]\\leftrightarrow\\langle M,\\in\\rangle\\models\\varphi[j\\circ\\vec a]))\\bigr]\\land j(\\kappa)&gt;\\lambda\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;(j(\\alpha)=\\alpha)\\land\\forall f\\in V\\;((f:\\lambda\\to M)\\to f\\in M)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}supercompact\\text{-}embedding\\text{-}characterization} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\operatorname{Supercompact}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa\\leq\\lambda\\to\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{Class}\\;\\exists j\\in\\mathsf{Class}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}_S(M)\\land j:V\\to M\\land\\bigl[\\forall r\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L_\\in)\\;\\forall\\vec a\\in V^r\\;(\\mathrm{FV}_{L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;r\\}\\to(\\langle V,\\in\\rangle\\models\\varphi[\\vec a]\\leftrightarrow\\langle M,\\in\\rangle\\models\\varphi[j\\circ\\vec a]))\\bigr]\\land j(\\kappa)&gt;\\lambda\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;(j(\\alpha)=\\alpha)\\land\\forall f\\in V\\;((f:\\lambda\\to M)\\to f\\in M)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This theorem gives the class-embedding characterization of the ultrafilter definition in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"623edb148c120615\" href=\"?note=623edb148c120615\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-supercompact-cardinal.md\">../batch18/58-df-supercompact-cardinal.md</a>.</li>\n<li>The quantified <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> is a proper-class elementary embedding in the metatheory; treating it as an ordinary set-sized three-place structure embedding would mix object and meta levels.</li>\n<li>Supercompactness implies strongness and measurability.</li>\n<li>Equivalently, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>-supercompactness can be described by normal fine measures on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_\\kappa(\\lambda)\">\\(P_\\kappa(\\lambda)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Supercompact cardinals yield powerful reflection principles.</li>\n<li>Supercompact cardinals imply <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V \\neq L\">\\(V \\neq L\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-supercompact-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"623edb148c120615","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-supercompact-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md","status":"resolved","id":"362d2f33099adc89","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"9976e7d9d98187f6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据